			<div class="content" id="post-content-3641353">
									

<p>Still enjoy the premise, but not the execution. In retrospect, I think the content of the logs would better geared towards focusing on building a mystery with each instance, that is, inducing the requested items without blunt statements from the Ds, and allowing readers to piece together everything that way. You could probably even make it work without the exposition in the recovery log.</p>
