<p>This is a strangely barebones skip, presented in a very matter-of-fact and stilted manner. There's just something slightly off, tone-wise, about the writing, and it overall comes off dry. That said, I'm somewhat tickled a research team would make a D-Class walk two weeks to get to Denver. I'm not sure that's going to fit a lot of people's headcanons, but, well, no vote.</p>

